{meta title='Signal flags'/}
<p class="nt-lead">Text spelt in the flags of the International Code of Signals, the flags ships
hoist: a flag for every letter in the code's colours and patterns, a numeral pennant for every
digit. Each flag shows its name in the phonetic alphabet on hover - Alfa, Bravo, Charlie - and
what it means hoisted alone: O is man overboard, V I require assistance.</p>

<p class="nt-tag">Written <code>{open/}signals 'PAD'/{close/}</code>; <code>size=</code> is the width of a
flag.</p>

{examples/}
